  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onions, minced garlic, and grated ginger, sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in chopped sweet potato cubes and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Pour in coconut milk, bring to a gentle simmer, then add thyme.",
    "Add anchovy fillets and cook for 15 minutes until sweet potato is soft.",
    "Remove from heat, stir in lime juice and season with salt and pepper.",
    "Pour a splash of rum over the hot stew and ignite carefully to flambe, swirl until flames subside.",
    "Serve hot over brown rice or quinoa, garnish with scallions."
  ],
